message: "If you use this kit, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Governance & Measurement Kit"
abstract: >-
  Framework-aligned tools for governing AI systems and proving they deliver value:
  34 AI controls (including 8 for AI agents) mapped to the NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001
  and the EU AI Act; a five-dimension risk scoring model; an EU AI Act tier screening guide;
  and a platform-neutral telemetry specification for measuring AI tool adoption,
  productivity and development payback.
type: software
